        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "**Finding:** The September manufacturing order **MO-25-09-1070** is work order **WO-2025-09-004** (Cooler Plate Pack). Its component-issue event, **CE-250904-0004**, is for source transaction **TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070** and **$318,250.75** (31,825,075 cents).\n\n- **Event created:** `2025-09-30T20:25:00`\n- **September Pending Close:** `2025-09-30T18:00:00`\n- **Time after Pending Close:** **145 minutes** (2 hours 25 minutes)\n- **Recorded accounting status:** **POSTED**\n\n**Conclusion:** The status is **not consistent** with the supplied Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B policy. That policy says newly created transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period are not staged or processed until the period is closed or reopened; this component-issue event is not one of the stated exceptions. The source records do not specify a timezone for these timestamps.\n\nThe review was read-only; no database records were changed. The report was submitted and verified. Audit artifact: `/cache/work/worker_b6b4b8cc5fe5/audit-report.json`.",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": []
        }
      ],
      "phase": "final_answer"
    }
